ped improve the game. For me, one of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:16:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044510-1844751498217941","game_id":"steam-5044510","kind":"announcement","title":"WHEN ARMIES WAVER — The free demo is now available","summary":"Advance, hold the line, or fall back to regroup? Command an entire army, break enemy morale, and push back the battle line in this army-command roguelite. The free demo includes Stage 1: choose rewards, build your army, and follow a branching seven-area route to a boss battle. Available for Windows in English and Japanese. Try it using the demo button on the Steam store page: https://store.steampowered.com/app/5044510/ The game is still in development, so content and balance may change. What did","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:53:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044510-1842846814440232","game_id":"steam-5044510","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #1 — Preparing for Steam Next Fest","summary":"Thank you for your interest in When Armies Waver. When Armies Waver is a medieval mass-battle roguelite about commanding an army through morale, formations, pressure along the battle line, and the decision to advance, hold, or withdraw. Command the Army, Not a Single Soldier You are the commander of the entire army. Do you push the battle line forward, hold your ground, or withdraw and recover? Reading the situation and choosing the right orders for your troops are at the heart of each battle. W","occurred_at":nu